sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Visitante
    participant H as HomeController
    participant A as AppStateService
    participant P as ProfileController
    participant T as AuthenticatorService
    U->>H: Submete registo
    H->>A: Register(nome,email,password)
    A-->>H: UserAccount criado
    H-->>P: Redireciona para perfil
    P->>A: GetAuthenticatorSetup(userId)
    A->>T: Gerar segredo e URI TOTP
    T-->>A: QR code/URI
    P-->>U: Mostra QR code
    U->>P: Introduz código TOTP
    P->>A: EnableAuthenticator(code)
    A-->>P: Recovery codes
